WEBVTT

00:08:56.076 --> 00:09:00.996
the issue of family reunification
is more than just an Irish issue.

00:09:01.716 --> 00:09:04.236
It's indeed a global issue,

00:09:04.236 --> 00:09:08.476
and it has been highlighted
by the recent takeover in Afghanistan

00:09:08.476 --> 00:09:11.396
and the ongoing
Israeli-Palestinian conflict.

00:09:11.956 --> 00:09:14.556
The sheer amount of families
who have been displaced

00:09:14.556 --> 00:09:17.556
and the thousands
of unaccompanied children arriving

00:09:17.556 --> 00:09:21.556
on the shores of countries
all over the world,

00:09:21.556 --> 00:09:22.716
Ireland included.

00:09:23.836 --> 00:09:28.836
If there are parents who want
to be together raising their children,

00:09:28.836 --> 00:09:32.356
no government should ever
stand in their way